        <tr>
          <td><span class="postbody">10. When you play you actually don't get depressed from how gloomy the atmosphere is.
<br />

<br />
9. With Engineering you man make a mechanical squirell pet that will follow you around.
<br />

<br />
8. With Engineering you can make exploding sheep.  Picture a sheep strapped with explosives sent forth to attack your foes.
<br />

<br />
7.  They have voice emotes and to quote /v flirt of the Tauren male "Where's the beef?  Here's the beef baby!"
<br />

<br />
6. The trolls are all Jamacian.  And you can be both an herbologist and an alchemist....
<br />

<br />
5. Hunters can train all sorts of animals as pets.
<br />

<br />
4. You can get a boomstick!
<br />

<br />
3. They have a Zepplin.
<br />

<br />
2. You can play undead or that Orc you always wanted to be.
<br />

<br />
1. The male orc /dance move....let's just say MC Hammer ain't got nothin' on this Orc.<br />_________________<br />Causing pain and suffering in friends, since the beginning of time.</span><span class="gensmall"><i></i></span></td>
